           (SDOT lane sums scaled per block in float lanes, FCVTNS activation
           quantization) -> src/infer/mormot.ai.infer.kernels.pas. The erf/erfc
           polynomials are our own fits (tools/infer-ref/fit_erf.py).
  Followed (phase 3, written anew - no code taken): the block formats Q4_0, Q4_K,
           Q6_K and Q8_K, quantize_row_q4_0_ref / quantize_row_q8_0_ref (roundf),
           the K-quant scale/min unpacking and the integer arithmetic of
           ggml_vec_dot_q4_K_q8_K / ggml_vec_dot_q6_K_q8_K (NEON and AVX2 paths)
           -> mormot.ai.infer.tensor / backend.cpu / kernels. Checked byte- and
