           commit 4fd1242bef6cb2325b4ff1c1a80f3b54b64508a6 vendored by sqlite-lembed;
           the repacking of the safetensors *_blocks / *_scales in
           convert_hf_to_gguf.py (GptOssModel), the gpt-oss tensor names and
           metadata (src/llama-arch.cpp, src/llama-model.cpp) and the SwiGLU constants
